  "unreadable": [],
  "notes": "Image 1 (LoRa module page) and image 6 (display/IMU page) show no wiring connectors. USB-C port signals, LoRa MMCX antenna and the battery skipped. Images 3 and 10 also show silkscreen text on the antenna holder (HEADERS: GND, 5V OUT, G7, G2, G6, BAT, 3V3, 5V IN) and QWIIC/GROVE silk, but the header pins themselves are not depicted there; not transcribed separately. Image 7 (dated 31 Oct 2025) orders the 8 x Header pins 4/5 as GPIO6 ~D3 / GPIO2 ~D2, while images 5, 8 and 12 show GPIO2 ~D2 / GPIO6 ~D3. IN/OUT power badges omitted as category tags. Pin 6 BATTERY has a printed note: Unregulated ~3-4.2 V battery rail, output-only. Do not back-feed."
}
